### Retrieve generation

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/{{generationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve generations

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Accept: application/json

### Validate rejection of an invalid request body

POST {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "materials": []
}

### Validate rejection of an invalid generation ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json

### Validate not-found behavior

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Accept: application/json